      <article class="keep"><span data-i18n="keep">KEEP / STRUCTURE</span><b data-i18n="keepTitle">Role essentials</b><small data-i18n="keepCopy">Ім’я, контакти, місто/timezone, мова, availability, роль, compensation expectation, portfolio / LinkedIn / professional social.</small></article>
      <article class="keep"><span data-i18n="evidence">ADD EVIDENCE</span><b data-i18n="evidenceTitle">Cases + KPI</b><small data-i18n="evidenceCopy">2–3 кейси: задача → дія → metric definition → baseline → actual → period → source / proof → особистий внесок.</small></article>
      <article class="keep"><span data-i18n="sampleWork">WORK SAMPLE</span><b data-i18n="sampleTitle">Candidate Assessment</b><small data-i18n="sampleCopy">Brief → deadline → sources → Google Docs / MindMap → 30-point rubric → reviewer notes → human decision.</small></article>
